    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n* Recall any times you've chatted with an AI bot, like a chatbot on a website, a virtual assistant, or even a game character.\r\n* Think about what kinds of information you might have shared in those conversations.\r\n* Identify if any of that information could be considered private or sensitive, based on what you've learned about data types.\r\n* Discuss with the bot why sharing certain types of information with AI might be risky.\r\n* Brainstorm with the bot ways to avoid accidentally sharing private details in future AI chats.\r\n* Ask the bot for tips on how to keep your personal information safe online when using AI tools.",
